I added `cheapestStart` at the end of `src/tariff.ts`. It quotes each start day from `fromDay` to `toDay` with `quoteHire` (no pets), and keeps the first day with the lowest `totalPence`, so ties go to the earliest day. The day is returned as given, not wrapped.

I couldn't see `quoteHire`'s body, so I'm assuming it accepts start days past 365 and quotes them correctly, as you said hire start days may run past the year end.
